Act, 2002 (39 of 2002), namely: - 


In the Multi-State Co-operative Societies Act, 2002, in the Second Schedule, - 


(1) after serial number 24 and the entry relating thereto, the following serial number and entry shall be inserted, 
namely: - 


“20. Cooperative Bank of India Limited, New Delhi.”; 
(1) for serial number 1, the following serial number shall be substituted, namely: - 
“1. National Cooperative Agricultural and Rural Development Banks Federation Limited, Mumbai.”; 
(iii) for serial number 19, the following serial number shall be substituted, namely: - 
“15. National Labour Cooperative Federation of India Limited, New Delhi.”; 
(iv) serial number 8 shall be renumbered as ‘7’; 
(v) serial number 9 shall be renumbered as ‘8’; 


(vi) serial number 10 shall be renumbered as ‘9’; 


